  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Lebanese Internal Security Forces in combating torture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the Internal Security Forces promote and protect human rights in Lebanon by developing more efficient internal control mechanisms that enhance protection of male and female detainees in custody of the ISF and help reduce risks of human rights violations.</narrative>
  </description>
